በስያ ኢታ ኡንቱንቶ ዛራ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ኡንቱንቱ ጾሳ ኦሱዋነ አ ኩሺ መዳዋ","poem":1},{"text":"ዶሰናን እጼዳ ድራዉ፥ ጾሳይ ኡንቱንታ ኮላና፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ዛሪደ ኡንቱንታ ኡባካ ኬጸና።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ታ ዋትዋቱዋ ስሴዳ ድራዉ፥ መና ጎዳይ ጋላተቶ።","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"መና ጎዳይ ታዉ ዎልቃነ ጎንዳለ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ታ ዎዛናይ አን አማነቴ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ሄዋን ታን ማደታድ።","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ሄዋ ድራዉ፥ ታ ዎዛናይ አን ናሸቴ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ታን የን አ ሳባና።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"መና ጎዳይ ባረ አሳዉ ዎልቃ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እ ባረ ኦኬዳ ካትያ አሽያ ሚጻ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ጾሳዉ፥ ነ አሳ አሻ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ነዉ ግድያዋንታ አንጃ።","poem":2},{"text":"ኡንቱንታ ሄምያዌ ኔና ግዳ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ኔን ኡንቱንታ መናዉካ ቶካ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/dwr_ent/PSA/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ent/PSA/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ent/PSA/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}